January (1) goes out as month 0. An empty item list prints no rows.
-- args --
calendar
month
2027
1
-- route GET /calendar-service/year/2027/month/0 --
{"startDayOfMonth":4,"numOfDaysInMonth":31,"numOfDaysInPrevMonth":30,"month":0,"year":2027,"calendarItems":[]}
